      "locked": false,
      "text": "4 API Design\n(REST API)\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4 API Design\n(REST API)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9Md6JBFnU5Z5QmrHSZGXA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 447.4135565251112,
      "y": 1019.749369730644,
      "width": 1033.119384765625,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b29",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1243947690,
      "version": 1329,
      "versionNonce": 628566966,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790632404606,
      "created": 1790631713508,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. POST /api/hotels\n- Description: allow hotel manager to add a new hotel to the platform\n- Params: name, description etc.\n\n2. POST /api/{hotel_Id}/room-types\n- Description: allows a hotel manager to add a new room type to hotel.\n- Params: hotel_id, name, description etc.\n\n3. GET /aopi/search\n- Description: allow users to search for hotels and room types based on filters and view available options\n- Params: location, check_in_date, check_out_date, num_guests, num_beds, num_guest etc.\n\n4. POST /api/reservations\n- Description : allows user to create a new reservation for room type.\n- Params: hotel_id, room_type_id, check_in_date, check_out_date",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. POST /api/hotels\n- Description: allow hotel manager to add a new hotel to the platform\n- Params: name, description etc.\n\n2. POST /api/{hotel_Id}/room-types\n- Description: allows a hotel manager to add a new room type to hotel.\n- Params: hotel_id, name, description etc.\n\n3. GET /aopi/search\n- Description: allow users to search for hotels and room types based on filters and view available options\n- Params: location, check_in_date, check_out_date, num_guests, num_beds, num_guest etc.\n\n4. POST /api/reservations\n- Description : allows user to create a new reservation for room type.\n- Params: hotel_id, room_type_id, check_in_date, check_out_date",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
